      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Chef Barinov insists he cannot wait until tomorrow and orders Timur to find the fresh fugu fish immediately while swearing him to secrecy. As soon as the Chef steps away, the anxious cooks corner Timur to find out what lethal ingredient Barinov just requested.",
      "gap": 0.8
